@startuml
participant "APScheduler" as Scheduler
participant "scheduler.py" as SchedulerPy
participant "alert_routes.py" as AlertRoutes
participant "ml_pipeline.py" as MLPipeline
participant "db_service.py / SQL" as DBLayer
database "MySQL" as MySQL
actor 管理员

Scheduler -> SchedulerPy : 到达触发时间
SchedulerPy -> AlertRoutes : scan_alerts()
AlertRoutes -> MLPipeline : detect_anomalies_for_api()
MLPipeline -> MySQL : 查询近7日销售数据
MySQL --> MLPipeline : 销售记录
MLPipeline -> MLPipeline : 计算异常值与基线
MLPipeline --> AlertRoutes : anomalies[]

AlertRoutes -> DBLayer : 查询启用的预警规则
DBLayer -> MySQL : SELECT alert_rule
MySQL --> DBLayer : rule list
DBLayer --> AlertRoutes : 规则列表

loop 每条异常
  AlertRoutes -> AlertRoutes : 匹配规则阈值
  alt 命中规则
    AlertRoutes -> DBLayer : 写入 alert_log
    DBLayer -> MySQL : INSERT alert_log
    MySQL --> DBLayer : success
    DBLayer --> AlertRoutes : log_id
  end
end

管理员 -> AlertRoutes : GET /api/alert/logs
AlertRoutes -> MySQL : 查询 alert_log
MySQL --> AlertRoutes : 日志列表
AlertRoutes --> 管理员 : 返回待处理告警
@enduml
